* The **source code** (src/glottogenera/*.py, scripts/, research/, tests/,
  web/ except web/vendor/ and web/data/, Makefile, workflows) is released
  under this MIT license. research/divergence/newick.py is forked from
  python-newick (https://github.com/dlce-eva/python-newick) and remains under
  the Apache License 2.0 (research/divergence/LICENSE-newick). The libraries vendored in
  web/vendor/ keep their own licenses (web/vendor/LICENSES.txt).
* The **dataset** (data/, cldf/, the release copies and the vendored Glottolog
  dump under src/glottogenera/data/, and web/data/) is released under the
  Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International license (see data/LICENSE).
  It derives from Glottolog, ASJP and WALS, all under CC BY 4.0; see
  docs/sources.md for attribution. The map outlines in web/data/ derive from
  Natural Earth (public domain).
